  designNotes: 'Mechanics test: Scorched Earth on a slot. The creature there can''t
    trigger its effects (entry, retaliation, Dawn and Dusk, death) or use its ability
    while it stands on it. It can still move and attack.'
  artDescription: 'The Banksy auction stunt: a spy''s portrait, painted in the style
    of Girl with Balloon, has just sold at auction, and the canvas is sliding down
    through a shredder hidden in its gilded frame, the strips stamped BURN NOTICE.
    In the audience, the spy himself watches his face being shredded.'
